      { "at": 1.8, "text": "Before time had a name, there was only the dark." },
      { "at": 7.2, "text": "Then I spoke a single word into the silence. Elyra." },
      { "at": 13.4, "text": "From the deep, the oceans rose. Continents broke the surface, and mountains reached for the stars." },
      { "at": 22.7, "text": "But no world is born in peace." },
      { "at": 26.6, "text": "Deep beneath its skin, the fire of creation still burns." },
      { "at": 32.9, "text": "This is Elyra. And this is only the beginning." },
